# repo's "Linux RISC-V boot" workflow (run 36576659198) and published
# unmodified; linux-riscv.yml re-checks that it still equals what this tree
# builds, so a core change that alters the machine's behaviour goes red here
# and the snapshot is rebuilt and republished (scripts/riscv32-linux-snapshot.mjs).
